! Using a file in a wiki

* ''Upload in the wiki:'' while editing a wiki you can upload the file directly there — it is stored with the wiki owner.
* ''Toolbar:'' the upload button loads the file into the wiki owner's file store. Afterwards a window shows the finished code for your tiddler: images as ``[img[...]]``, all other files as ``[ext[...]]``. Paste the code into any tiddler to display the file.
* ''Files in this wiki:'' the folder button in the toolbar opens a list of all files of the wiki with preview, download link and copyable code.
* ''Wiki owners (teacher/admin):'' files uploaded to your own wikis are permanently available to that wiki.
* ''Visibility:'' anyone who may open the wiki (read access) can see its files; no separate share is needed. Personal files from "My files" stay private and are not affected.
* Guests with read access see the content but cannot add files.